text: ['Activated abilities of nontoken Rebels cost an additional "Sacrifice a land" to activate.', 'All combat damage that would be dealt to you this turn by target unblocked creature is dealt to its controller instead.', 'As Heightened Awareness enters the battlefield, discard your hand.\nAt the beginning of your draw step, draw an additional card.', "At the beginning of each player's end step, Citadel of Pain deals X damage to that player, where X is the number of untapped lands they control.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player mills a card. Then they create X 1/1 black Minion creature tokens, where X is the milled card's mana value.", 'At the beginning of your end step, if you control no untapped lands, draw a card.', 'At the beginning of your end step, if you control no untapped lands, you gain 2 life.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Darba unless you pay {G}{G}.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Whipstitched Zombie unless you pay {B}.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may exile a land card from your graveyard. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "Basic lands each player controls have shroud as long as that player controls three or fewer lands. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities.)", "Branded Brawlers can't attack if defending player controls an untapped land.\nBranded Brawlers can't block if you control an untapped land.", 'Celestial Convergence enters the battlefield with seven omen counters on it.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, remove an omen counter from Celestial Convergence. If there are no omen counters on Celestial Convergence, the player with the highest life total wins the game. If two or more players are tied for highest life total, the game is a draw.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {X}, where X is its mana value.', 'Creatures you control get +0/+1 until end of turn. They get an additional +0/+2 until end of turn unless any player pays {2}.', 'Creatures you control get +7/+7 until end of turn.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{3}: Destroy Wall of Vipers and target creature it's blocking. Any player may activate this ability.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{4}: Return Quicksilver Wall to its owner's hand. Any player may activate this ability.", "Destroy all creatures you don't control. They can't be regenerated.", "Destroy all enchantments you don't control. Then if you control an untapped land, destroy all enchantments you control.", 'Destroy target land. Devastate deals 1 damage to each creature and each player.', 'Destroy target land. Its controller loses 2 life.', 'Draw three cards. Then if any player pays {2}, discard three cards.', 'Each player creates a green Elephant creature token. Those creatures have "This creature\'s power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in its controller\'s graveyard."', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can block any number of creatures.', 'Enchant land\nEnchanted land has "{T}: Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}."', 'Enchant land\nEnchanted land has "{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn."', 'Enchant land\nEnchanted land has "{T}: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn."', 'Enchant land\nEnchanted land has "{T}: This land deals 1 damage to any target."', 'Enchant land\nEnchanted land has "{T}: This land deals 1 damage to each creature and each player."', "Enchant land\nEnchanted land is a 5/6 green Treefolk creature that's still a land.", 'Exile target attacking creature unless its controller pays {X}.', "Fen Stalker has fear as long as you control no untapped lands. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'First strike\n{2}: Zerapa Minotaur loses first strike until end of turn. Any player may activate this ability.', 'Flash\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2.', 'Flash\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -3/-0.', "Flash\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature has shroud. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Flash\nEnchant creature\nWhenever enchanted creature deals combat damage to defending player, you may destroy target artifact that player controls.', 'Flash\nEnchant creature\n{1}{G}: Regenerate enchanted creature.', 'Flying\nAt the beginning of your end step, tap all lands you control.', 'Flying\nSacrifice Spiketail Drake: Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', "Flying\nSacrifice a land: Return Stormwatch Eagle to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\nSacrifice two lands: Jeweled Spirit gains protection from artifacts or from the color of your choice until end of turn.', "Flying\nWhen Windscouter attacks or blocks, return it to its owner's hand at end of combat. (Return it only if it's on the battlefield.)", 'Flying\n{2}: Ribbon Snake loses flying until end of turn. Any player may activate this ability.', 'Flying\n{T}, Sacrifice X lands: Put X +1/+1 counters on Copper-Leaf Angel.', 'Flying\n{T}, Sacrifice a land: Search your library for a Mercenary permanent card with mana value 2 or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nSacrifice Spiketail Hatchling: Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.", 'Flying, first strike\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Pit Raptor unless you pay {2}{B}{B}.', 'Flying, vigilance', "Hazy Homunculus can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an untapped land.", "Hollow Warrior can't attack or block unless you tap an untapped creature you control not declared as an attacking or blocking creature this combat. (This cost is paid as attackers or blockers are declared.)", "If an opponent controls at least four more creatures than you, this spell costs {6} less to cast.\nTrample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", 'If an opponent controls seven or more lands, this spell costs {6} less to cast.\nFlying\n{R}: Avatar of Fury gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'If an opponent has no cards in hand, this spell costs {6} less to cast.\nFlying', "If there are ten or more creature cards total in all graveyards, this spell costs {6} less to cast.\nFear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\n{T}: Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'If you have 3 or less life, this spell costs {6} less to cast.\nFlying\nAvatar of Hope can block any number of creatures.', 'Inflame deals 2 damage to each creature dealt damage this turn.', "Lands target player controls don't untap during their next untap step.", "Mercenaries don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", "Mercenary Informer can't be the target of black spells or abilities from black sources.\n{2}{W}: Put target nontoken Mercenary on the bottom of its owner's library.", 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Glittering Lion.\n{3}: Until end of turn, Glittering Lion loses "Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Glittering Lion." Any player may activate this ability.', 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Glittering Lynx.\n{2}: Until end of turn, Glittering Lynx loses "Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Glittering Lynx." Any player may activate this ability.', 'Protection from white\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Bog Elemental unless you sacrifice a land.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on each of X target creatures.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\nSacrifice a land: Spitting Spider deals 1 damage to each creature with flying.', "Rebel Informer can't be the target of white spells or abilities from white sources.\n{3}: Put target nontoken Rebel on the bottom of its owner's library.", "Reorder your graveyard at random. An opponent chooses a card at random in your graveyard. If it's a creature card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, exile it.", "Return target creature to its owner's hand. Then return another target creature to its owner's hand unless its controller pays {1}.", 'Return two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand unless any player pays {X}.', "Rhystic Lightning deals 4 damage to any target unless that permanent's controller or that player pays {2}. If they do, Rhystic Lightning deals 2 damage to the permanent or player.", 'Sacrifice Spore Frog: Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Sacrifice a land: Coastal Hornclaw gains flying until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice a land: Destroy target enchantment.', 'Sacrifice a land: Fault Riders gets +2/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', 'Sacrifice a land: Prevent the next 2 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', 'Sacrifice a land: Trenching Steed gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice two lands: Return Coffin Puppets from your graveyard to the battlefield. Activate only during your upkeep and only if you control a Swamp.', 'Scoria Cat gets +3/+3 as long as you control no untapped lands.', "Search target player's library for up to seven cards and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", 'Searing Wind deals 10 damage to any target.', 'Spur Grappler gets +2/+1 as long as you control no untapped lands.', "Swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", 'Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn. Another target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn. That creature gets an additional +4/+4 until end of turn unless any player pays {2}.', 'Target player discards a card at random. Then that player discards another card at random unless they pay {1}.', "Target player reveals their hand. You choose an instant or sorcery card from it and exile that card. You may cast that card for as long as it remains exiled. At the beginning of the next end step, if you haven't cast the card, return it to its owner's hand.", "Target player's life total becomes 20.", 'Trample', "Trample\nKeldon Battlewagon can't block.\nWhen Keldon Battlewagon attacks, sacrifice it at end of combat.\nTap an untapped creature you control: Keldon Battlewagon gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is the power of the creature tapped this way.", 'Trample\n{3}: Vintara Elephant loses trample until end of turn. Any player may activate this ability.', 'Unless any player pays {2}, search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Unless target player pays {3}, that player loses 5 life and you gain 5 life.', "Up to three target creatures can't block this turn.", "Veteran Brawlers can't attack if defending player controls an untapped land.\nVeteran Brawlers can't block if you control an untapped land.", "Vintara Snapper has shroud as long as you control no untapped lands. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'When Gulf Squid enters the battlefield, tap all lands target player controls.', 'When Keldon Firebombers enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices all lands they control except for three.', 'When Silt Crawler enters the battlefield, tap all lands you control.', 'When there are no creatures on the battlefield, sacrifice Task Mage Assembly.\n{2}: Task Mage Assembly deals 1 damage to target creature. Any player may activate this ability but only as a sorcery.', "Whenever Death Charmer deals combat damage to a creature, that creature's controller loses 2 life unless they pay {2}.", 'Whenever Fickle Efreet attacks or blocks, flip a coin at end of combat. If you lose the flip, an opponent gains control of Fickle Efreet.', 'Whenever Keldon Berserker attacks, if you control no untapped lands, it gets +3/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Lesser Gargadon attacks or blocks, sacrifice a land.', 'Whenever Plague Fiend deals combat damage to a creature, destroy that creature unless its controller pays {2}.', "Whenever Shrouded Serpent attacks, defending player may pay {4}. If that player doesn't, Shrouded Serpent can't be blocked this turn.", "Whenever Soul Charmer deals combat damage to a creature, you gain 2 life unless that creature's controller pays {2}.", 'Whenever Thresher Beast becomes blocked, defending player sacrifices a land.', "Whenever a nontoken creature enters the battlefield, its controller creates a token that's a copy of that creature.\nWhenever a nontoken creature leaves the battlefield, exile all tokens with the same name as that creature.\nWhen Dual Nature leaves the battlefield, exile all tokens created with Dual Nature.", "Whenever a player puts a nontoken creature onto the battlefield, that player returns a land they control to its owner's hand.", 'Whenever an opponent casts a spell, you may draw a card unless that player pays {1}.', 'Whenever one or more creatures attack you, if Reveille Squad is untapped, you may untap all creatures you control.', 'Wing Storm deals damage to each player equal to twice the number of creatures with flying that player controls.', 'Wintermoon Mesa enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Wintermoon Mesa: Tap two target lands.', "You can't untap more than one land during your untap step.", "You may discard a Forest card rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt by unblocked creatures this turn.", "You may discard a Mountain card rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nFlameshot deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three target creatures.", "You may discard a Plains card rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nDestroy target artifact or enchantment.", "You may discard a Swamp card rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nChoose a creature type. All creatures of that type get -1/-1 until end of turn.", "You may discard an Island card and another card rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nCounter target spell.", '{0}: Tap all lands you control. Chimeric Idol becomes a 3/3 Turtle artifact creature until end of turn.', '{1}, Sacrifice a land: Draw a card. Any player may activate this ability.', '{1}, Sacrifice two lands: Destroy target land.', '{1}: Any player may pay {1}. If no one does, the next time a source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}{B}, Sacrifice a land: Target creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', '{1}{G}, Sacrifice a land: Create two 1/1 green Squirrel creature tokens.\n{1}{G}, Sacrifice a land: Squirrel creatures get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{2}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn. Any player may activate this ability.', "{2}{G}, {T}, Discard two cards: All lands target player controls become 3/3 creatures until end of turn. They're still lands.", '{2}{W}: The next time target attacking creature would deal combat damage to Shield Dancer this turn, that creature deals that damage to itself instead.', "{2}{W}{W}, {T}, Discard two cards: Destroy all creatures except for Mageta the Lion. Those creatures can't be regenerated.", "{4}: Return target creature card from a graveyard to its owner's hand. Any player may activate this ability but only as a sorcery.", '{B}: Nakaya Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn unless any player pays {2}.', '{B}: Regenerate Chilling Apparition.\nWhenever Chilling Apparition deals combat damage to a player, that player discards a card.', '{R}: Ridgeline Rager gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{R}: Target creature gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack this turn.)', '{T}, Sacrifice Mine Bearer: Destroy target attacking creature.', '{T}: Choose a color. Add one mana of that color unless any player pays {1}. Activate only as an instant.', '{U}: Tap target creature unless its controller pays {1}.', '{W}{W}: Target attacking creature gets -1/-0 until end of turn.', '{X}{B}, {T}, Discard two cards: Target player discards X cards at random.', '{X}{R}, {T}, Discard two cards: Latulla, Keldon Overseer deals X damage to any target.', "{X}{U}, {T}, Discard two cards: Return X target creatures to their owners' hands."]
